3-b291-40ec-b57b-250c6dfbee0f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:5fe8ee03-b291-40ec-b57b-250c6dfbee0f\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a Stone Bed, in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ironfinger\" title=\"Ironfinger\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Portrait_Ironfinger.png/25px-Portrait_Ironfinger.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Portrait_Ironfinger.png/38px-Portrait_Ironfinger.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Portrait_Ironfinger.png/50px-Portrait_Ironfinger.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ironfinger's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Portrait_Ironfinger.png/25px-Portrait_Ironfinger.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Portrait_Ironfinger.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ironfinger\" title=\"Ironfinger\">Ironfinger's</a> room in the north-western part of the Barracks in the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">Mind Flayer Colony</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>She's... she's going to put one in me any day. <a href=\"/wiki/Kressa_Bonedaughter\" title=\"Kressa Bonedaughter\">Kressa</a>, who was initiated the very same hour as I, all those years ago. She's going to put a <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen\" title=\"Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen\">parasite</a> in my ear when I sleep. Can't bear to be without a pet to experiment on. Needs to have a thrall locked away, so she can go further than <a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar\" title=\"Balthazar\">Balthazar</a> will let her. <br>\nKressa... I remember when we were just stomping on ant piles and raising them back up. Our very first deaths. I hope you remember, somewhere.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203351\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1858/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31931/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8413/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930685/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   46.199      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   46.199      1 -total\n 56.53%   26.116      8 Template:Icon_text\n 50.21%   23.197     19 Template:Trim\n 23.10%   10.670      2 Template:Uid\n 15.58%    7.197      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.72%    6.800      3 Template:Icon_link\n 13.74%    6.347      2 Template:Template_style\n  9.83%    4.540      8 Template:Ifempty\n  9.66%    4.463      2 Template:CharLink\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12550-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203351 and revision id 337837. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}